			</h5>
			<table style="width:100%; padding:0pt; border-collapse:collapse">
				<tr>
					<td style="width:497.5pt; border-left:0.75pt solid #0070b9; border-bottom:0.75pt solid #0070b9; padding:0pt 0pt 1.4pt 1.02pt; vertical-align:middle">
						<h6 style="margin:1pt 1pt 1pt 4pt; line-height:13pt">
							<a id="_Toc241710672"><span style="font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; color:#0070b9">ARTICLE</span> <span style="font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; color:#0070b9">2</span> <span style="color:#ffffff">: </span><br><span style="font-size:10pt; color:#0070b9">Soutenir le travail en revalorisant le barème de l’impôt sur le revenu grâce à un traitement fiscal équivalent des différents types de revenus</span></a> 
