			<p class="assnatBodyText">
				 
			</p>
		</div>
		<br style="clear:both; mso-break-type:section-break">
		<div class="assnatSection137">
			<h2 style="margin-top:24pt; margin-bottom:24pt; line-height:14pt">
				<a id="_Toc241710734"><span style="font-size:14pt; text-transform:uppercase; color:#0070b9">SECONDE PARTIE : MOYENS DES POLITIQUES PUBLIQUES ET DISPOSITIONS SPÉCIALES</span></a> 
			</h2>
			<h3 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:18pt; line-height:13pt">
				<a id="_Toc241710735"><span style="font-size:13pt; text-transform:uppercase">TITRE PREMIER : DISPOSITIONS POUR 2027</span></a> 
			</h3>
			<h4 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:18pt; font-size:12pt">
				<a id="_Toc241710736"><span style="font-style:italic; text-transform:uppercase">I – Autorisation des crédits des missions et performance</span></a><span style="font-size:8.5pt"> </span>
			</h4>
			<h5 style="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:18pt; font-size:12pt">
				<a id="_Toc241710737"><span style="color:#0070b9">A. - Crédits des missions</span></a><span style="font-size:7.5pt"> </span>
			</h5>
			<table style="width:100%; padding:0pt; border-collapse:collapse">
				<tr>
					<td style="width:497.5pt; border-left:0.75pt solid #0070b9; border-bottom:0.75pt solid #0070b9; padding:0pt 0pt 1.4pt 1.02pt; vertical-align:middle">
						<h6 style="margin:1pt 1pt 1pt 4pt; line-height:13pt">
							<a id="_Toc241710738"><span style="font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; color:#0070b9">ARTICLE</span> <span style="font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; color:#0070b9">58</span> <span style="color:#ffffff">: </span><br><span style="font-size:10pt; color:#0070b9">Crédits du budget général</span></a> 
						</h6>
					</td>
				</tr>
			</table>
			<p class="assnatFPFdebutartexte">
				 
			</p>
			<p class="assnatFPFdebutartexte">
				 
			</p>
			<div style="width:28.35pt">
				<p class="assnatPastille">
					<span style="font-size:7pt">(1)</span>
				</p>
			</div>
