							<p class="assnatenteteequilibre">
								Plafond <br>exprimé en ETPT
							</p>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<td style="width:368.45pt; border-right:0.75pt solid #0070b9; padding:0pt 1.02pt; vertical-align:top">
