								Administration territoriale de l’État
							</p>
						</td>
						<td style="width:77.35pt; padding:0pt 1.02pt 0pt 0pt; vertical-align:top">
							<p class="assnatligneequilibre">
								167
							</p>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="width:368.45pt; border-right:0.75pt solid #0070b9; padding:0pt 1.02pt; vertical-align:top">
							<p class="assnatligneequilibreg">
								Conduite et pilotage des politiques de l’intérieur
							</p>
						</td>
						<td style="width:77.35pt; padding:0pt 1.02pt 0pt 0pt; vertical-align:top">
							<p class="assnatligneequilibre">
								317
